 请导出这段视频 00:00:08 位置的一张关键帧图片。\\n任务规划：\\n1. 加载输入的视频源文件，解析其容器格式、总时长、帧率及时间轴基准，将用户指定的00:00:08时间戳映射为精确的帧索引或采样偏移量，输出结构化读取配置。\\n2. 依托视频监控场景的视频流处理模块，按计算出的帧索引执行单帧解码与抓取操作，完成像素级提取与通用图像格式转码，输出待校验的关键帧图像数据。\\n3. 对提取的图像执行分辨率核对、时间戳对齐验证与视觉内容完整性检查，确认满足安防巡检场景的图片导出标准后，封装可交付的图片文件并生成包含原始视频路径与截取时间的溯源日志。\\n场景任务：\\n- video_surveillance: 我将导出这段视频在00:00:08位置的一张关键帧图片。；参数：{'视频对象': '这段视频', '时间范围': '00:00:08', '输出形式': '图片'}\\n已提取参数：{'视频对象': '这段视频', '时间范围': '00:00:08', '输出形式': '图片'}\\n任务提示：\\n- 提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧\\n- 提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等\\n- 提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/ffmpeg-utils\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/ffmpeg-utils/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/ffmpeg-utils/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/ffmpeg-utils\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"5808b72c-5d0a-463f-aeb0-a845e5933d47","tool_call_id":"call_811f345de5384f5da24b0851","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":107,"prompt_tokens":14419,"total_tokens":14526,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":46,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":107},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":14419}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-959aba2a-afbe-9a12-8fc3-3e7cb2868558","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e65-c332-7f53-b95d-576215073184-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取 ffmpeg-utils 技能的详细说明文档","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/ffmpeg-utils/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_f2666a11198d4476a736edef","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":14419,"output_tokens":107,"total_tokens":14526,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":46}}}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"请导出这段视频 00:00:08 位置的一张关键帧图片。","normalized_query":"请导出这段视频 00:00:08 位置的一张关键帧图片。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_sur